OL,3,GNEWSAMP says he will challenge mill
OL,4,Aarson sentence
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP has described the sentence given
OL,7,Fto a man who was part of a group which
OL,8,Fcaused #15m of damage to Keighley's
OL,9,FGrade II* listed Dalton Mills complex
OL,10,Fin an arson attack as "absolutely
OL,11,Fpathetic".
OL,13,FKeighley and Ilkley MP Robbie Moore
OL,14,Fsaid he would refer the "lenient
OL,15,Fsentence" of McKenzie Mottram to the
OL,16,FAttorney General for review.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
