OL,3,GNEWSAMP says he will challenge mill
OL,4,Aarson sentence
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt Bradford Crown Court on Monday, the
OL,7,F20-year-old was given a suspended
OL,8,Fsentence and ordered to complete 200
OL,9,Fhours of unpaid work for his role in
OL,10,Fthe blaze, which destroyed the Genappe
OL,11,FMill on 3 March 2022.
OL,13,FMottram, who was 15 at the time of the
OL,14,Ffire, was found guilty alongside
OL,15,Fco-defendant Keaton Greenman, 19, after
OL,16,Fa trial at Bradford Youth Court in
OL,17,FAugust 2024.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
